title: Merchant
---
Merchant: Interested in buying or selling something?
-> Buy something
    <<jump MerchantBuy>>
-> Sell something
    <<jump MerchantSell>>
-> Leave
    {$playerName}: Maybe another time.
    Merchant: Come back anytime.
===
title: MerchantBuy
---
Merchant: What are you looking for?
-> Buy potion - 25 gold
    <<if get_money() >= 25>>
        {$playerName}: I'll take the potion.
        <<spend_money GameManager 25>>
        Merchant: Here you go.
        <<jump Merchant>>
    <<else>>
        Merchant: You don't have enough money for that.
        <<jump Merchant>>
    <<endif>>
-> Go back
    <<jump Merchant>>
===

title: MerchantSell
---
Merchant: What are you looking to sell?
-> Sell Gem - 15 gold
    {$playerName}: I've got this gem. Interested?
    Merchant: I'll give you 15 gold for it.
    <<add_money GameManager 15>>
    {$playerName}: Deal.
    Merchant: Pleasure doing business with you.
    <<jump Merchant>>
-> Never mind
    {$playerName}: Actually, I'll hold onto my things.
    <<jump Merchant>>
===
